# Toolchain pins for the Mitra build. Consumed by asdf / mise / proto / version-fox.
# CI uses these too (via setup-java in .github/workflows/ci.yml — keep the Java version aligned).
#
# Why pin? Build reproducibility. AGP 8.5 requires JDK 17. Kotlin 2.2 + AGP 8.5 requires Gradle 8.9+.
# Bumping any one of these without bumping the others tends to break the Compose compiler plugin.
java 17.0.13
gradle 8.9
kotlin 2.2.21
